      "id": "unique-event-007:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#7 - Star of Ill Omen\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1579,1601]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A shooting star flares up in the sky.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1601,1639]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You try to make a wish but your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1639,1671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "thoughts are ominous. Save vs. L2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1671,1705]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Fear. If you fail, lose 1 Sanity and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1705,1742]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have -1 to Attack and Defense rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1742,1778]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for your next combat. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1778,1807]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-007:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "succeed, carry on as normal.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1807,1835]]"
    }
  ],
